  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_10_q: 'Can sidewalls be customized separately from the canopy?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_10_a_html: 'Yes—sidewalls can be sized and printed to match your frame series and campaign. Separate replenishment is common; keep hook placements and zipper lines consistent by referencing the original BOM. Use": ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_10_q: '¿Pueden los muros laterales ser personalizados separadamente del recipiente?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_10_a_html: 'Sí-los muros laterales pueden ser tamaño e impresos para que coincida con su serie de marcos y campaña. La reposición separada es común; mantener las colocaciones de ganchos y las líneas de cremallera consistentes por referencia al BOM original.",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_1_q: 'What sizes are available for custom canopy tents?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_1_a_html: 'We supply common commercial footprints including 3×3 m, 3×4.5 m, and 3×6 m styles among others. Exact availability depends on frame series—use": ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_1_q: '¿Qué tamaños están disponibles para carpas personalizadas?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_1_a_html: 'We supply common commercial footprints including 3×3 m, 3×4.5 m, and 3×6 m styles among others. La disponibilidad exacta depende de la serie de marcos: uso",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_3_q: 'Do you offer aluminum and steel frames?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_3_a_html: 'Yes. Aluminum suits frequent transport; steel can reduce unit cost for budget-led programs. Specify intended use when contacting us so we recommend the right": ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_3_q: '¿Ofreces marcos de aluminio y acero?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_3_a_html: 'Sí. El aluminio se adapta al transporte frecuente; el acero puede reducir el costo unitario para los programas dirigidos por presupuesto. Especifique el uso deseado cuando nos contactemos así que recomendamos la derecha",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_6_q: 'Can sidewalls and accessories be included?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_6_a_html: 'Yes—sidewalls, weights, and related hardware can be quoted with your frame. Mention venue requirements (e.g., fire retardancy) when requesting": ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_6_q: '¿Pueden ser incluidos los muros laterales y accesorios?', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_6_a_html: 'Sí—siguiente, pesos y hardware relacionado se puede citar con su marco.",
  ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_h2: 'Custom Canopy Tents — Frequently Asked Questions', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_intro_html: 'Quick answers for buyers; full detail in our": ".', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_h2: 'Custom Canopy Tents — Preguntas Frecuentes', landing_canopy_buyers_faq_intro_html: 'Quick responses for buyers; full detail in our",
  ".', landing_canopy_specs_4_h3: 'Sidewalls & accessories', landing_canopy_specs_4_html: 'Optional sidewalls, half walls, rail skirts, and hardware-compatible weights—list add-ons in your RFQ for a single BOM.', landing_canopy_specs_5_h3: 'MOQ & lead time', landing_canopy_specs_5_html: 'Varies by print complexity and season; review": ".', landing_canopy_specs_4_h3: 'Sidewalls ' accesorios', landing_canopy_specs_4_html: 'Optional sidewalls, half walls, rail faldas, and hardware-compatible weights—list add-ons in your RFQ for a single BOM.', landing_canopy_specs_5_h3 time: 'MOQ > landing_canopy_specs_5_html: 'Varios por complejidad y temporada de impresión; comentario",
  ".', landing_canopy_type_3_h3: '3×6 custom canopy tents', landing_canopy_type_3_html: 'High-visibility footprints for sponsor lanes and outdoor retail—ideal when you need maximum graphic area on a single frame. See real-scene examples in the gallery above and": ".', landing_canopy_type_3_h3: '3×6 carpas plegables personalizadas', landing_canopy_type_3_html: 'High-visibility footprints for sponsor lanes and outdoor retail—ideal when you need maximum graphic area on a single frame. See real-scene examples in the gallery above and",
